<h1>midrange</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
The sum of the minimum and maximum values, divided by two.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="mean.html"><em>mean</em></a>, <a href="median.html"><em>median</em></a>, <a href="mode.html"><em>mode</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
The midrange of 1, 1, 3, 50, and 60 is 30.5. (1 + 60) / 2 = 30.5.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

